/help
Lists every command.

/stats || [day]
Shows a day's scores; finished days also get percentiles, the questions and the card.

/score || [user] [day]
Shows someone's result for a day and where it ranks among today's players.

/day
Shows which Krillion is live and when the next one starts.

/drop || [day]
Deletes your score for a day, or all of them, after confirming twice.

/krill || [day]
Shows a day's 100-point krillion answers and their quips, spoilered.

/forcedaily
Posts today's report now: scores, percentiles, questions and the card.

/top || [type] [since]
Pages through this server's leaderboards (best, worst, average, games played).

/topu || [user] [since]
Shows someone's rank on every leaderboard, with a card charting their scores over that period.

/mg-cleartopu || [user]
Deletes cached /topu cards (someone's, or everyone's in this server after confirming) so they're drawn fresh.

/compare || [user1] [user2] [since]
Puts two players' ranks and scores side by side; with one, you against them, with none, you against this server.

/quantile || [p] [ci]
Shows what score beats p% of games here and globally, all-time, with a ci% confidence interval (default 90).

/topg || [since]
This server versus the global median.

/mg-cleartopg
Deletes this server's cached /topg cards so they're drawn fresh.

/mg-clearcompare || [user]
Deletes cached /compare cards (every pair someone's in, or every pair in this server after confirming) so they're drawn fresh.

/mg-refetchtop
Rebuilds this server's leaderboards now, then shows them.

/mg-drop [user] [day]
Deletes someone's score for a day (or every day, with -1) after confirming twice.

/mg-blacklist show
Lists who's left off the leaderboards.

/mg-blacklist add [user]
Leaves someone off the leaderboards.

/mg-blacklist remove [user]
Puts someone back on the leaderboards.

/show || [all]
Lists the channels where results are read.

/mg-track || [all]
Starts reading results in this channel.

/mg-untrack || [all]
Stops reading results in this channel.

/mg-mainchan
Makes this channel the one daily reports are posted in.

/mg-backfill
Reads old results in this channel back to a date you pick.

/rank || [user]
Shows someone's bot rank.

/mg-modrank [user] [rank]
Sets someone's bot rank (below your own).

/ping
Checks the bot is responding.

/version
Shows the bot's version.

